      "worked": "In table row order:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}0.375&=\\frac{375}{1000}=\\frac38\\\\0.375\\times100\\%&=37.5\\%\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac13&=0.\\overline3\\\\\\frac13\\times100\\%&=\\frac{100}{3}\\%=33\\frac13\\%\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}75\\%&=\\frac{75}{100}=\\frac34\\\\75\\%&=0.75\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\frac34&=2+0.75=2.75\\\\2.75\\times100\\%&=275\\%\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}300\\%&=\\frac{300}{100}=3\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe fraction and decimal entries in the last row are both $3$.",
